# Status board (Cursor main agent)

One board. Three surfaces (same Jobs):

| Surface | Where |
|---------|--------|
| Chat | **Work report** (self-contained) + end-of-turn tables (`end-of-turn-worker-brief.mdc`) |
| Canvas | `canvases/active-workers-board.canvas.tsx` (`active-workers-canvas.mdc`) |
| Slack | `#coding-agents` thread + reactions (`slack-coding-agents.mdc`) — team mirror, not Chase’s SoT |

Do not keep a second job list. The canvas is the durable **board**;
chat reprints it at end of turn. The **report** lives in chat prose.
Slack must not be the only place the work is explained. Chat copy =
Chase’s language. Identifiers stay English.

This is **not** a poll loop. One-shot reconcile, then rewrite both
surfaces if the set changed.

## Lanes (Chase lock 2026-08-25)

| Lane | Korean | When |
|------|--------|------|
| Live | `지금` | Process still running |
| Staging | `스테이징` | Work **finished at the worker-process layer** (worker exited / PR open / MQ / issue filed). **Chase has not confirmed.** Worker exit ≠ 완료. 완료 to Chase only after `origin/main` `(#N)`. |
| Backlog | `백로그` | Sat in `스테이징` **≥ 24 hours** with no confirm |
| Confirmed | `확인됨` | Chase **explicitly** confirmed — that is the only **resolve** |

Clock for the 24h move: **entered staging** (worker process ended / train
left `지금`). Not launch time.

**Never** auto-resolve. Finished ≠ confirmed. `스테이징` / `백로그` →
`확인됨` only when Chase says so (컨펌, 확인, resolve, LGTM on that Job).

Confirm is per Job (or Chase names the issue). Do not clear the whole
board because one train was confirmed.

## Truth (anti-overcount)

`지금` = intersection of:

- Cursor terminals with **alive PID** + still-running worker command
- Live `claude-human-stream` / `agent-human-stream` / `grok -p`

Logs enrich only — not proof of liveness. Stale `running` terminal, no
process = omit from `지금`. Finished → `스테이징` **same turn**, not
`확인됨`.

## 진행 (Chase lock 2026-08-28)

Every **`지금`** row must say **where the worker is**, not only that it
is alive. Add a **`진행`** column.

One-shot (not a poll): when reprinting the board, read the Job’s
`opus-live` log tail and/or the last `🤖` / tool / in-progress todo.
Write ≤12 words in Chase’s language, with a noun (file, PR, issue,
`gt` step).

Good: `Layer 1 파일 작성`, `docs sprite 매핑`, `#5078 코멘트 초안`,
`gt Ready 대기`.
Forbidden as the whole cell: `running`, `working`, `진행 중` with no
noun.

`스테이징` does not use `진행` — that lane is already “worker finished,
Chase not confirmed.” Use **왜 여기** / **노트**.

## Chat tables (every turn)

Print **`지금`** and **`스테이징`** every turn. Print **`백로그`** when
it has rows.

**Never show `확인됨`.** Resolve drops the Job off the board. Do not
print a resolved table in chat or canvas.

### 지금

| Job | Issue | 모델 | session_id | 시그널 | 진행 |
|-----|-------|------|------------|--------|------|

Empty → one row `—` / `없음`. **`진행`** is required on every live
row (see § 진행).

### 스테이징

| Job | Issue | 왜 여기 | 노트 |
|-----|-------|---------|------|

Required: issue OPEN/CLOSED, **why still OPEN** if open, PR + MQ/`main`
tip `(#N)`, Graphite FF quirk if needed. Not a one-line “done”.
If the PR is still in Graphite “Your changes” / not on `origin/main`,
the note must say **`LANDED: no`** — never imply 완료.

Include **entered staging** (KST) so the 24h clock is visible.

### 백로그

Same columns as 스테이징 + **staged since**. Still waiting for Chase
confirm — just aged out of 스테이징.

## Job title = terminal title (Chase lock 2026-08-07)

| Kind | Exact Job |
|------|-----------|
| Opus | `Opus : <job-slug> (#<issue>)` |
| Grok | `Grok : <job-slug> (#<issue>)` |
| Explore | `Explore : <job-slug>` |

Resume/steer keeps that string. No prose titles.

## Non-goals

- Not completion-notification monitoring (no `AwaitShell` poll loops)
- Codex / Claude Code as main agent: ignore (Cursor-only)
